  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5740b8c25e94a7653b1622ebd769850d8df181bc.png\" alt=\"带有风铃图标和文字“风铃”的横幅\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f51d1b5a10ec99cfe5528f63d9bebfb507f6280.gif\" alt=\"竹制、铜制和铁制风铃\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>本模组是对原公有领域 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwindchimes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">风铃模组</a>（由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fhibi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">hibi</a> 制作）的忠实延续。</p>\n<p>本项目的目标是使原版模组的内容在 Fabric 和 NeoForge 的现代 Minecraft 版本中保持更新。</p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ced202c33e70f5e5f586f6fbb46466c96ed4fcfb.webp\">\n</div>",
